  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Africa, Latin America and Caribbean Trade Policy Course - Short Term Training Scholarship</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Activity seeks to deliver&#xa0;a Trade Policy short course, to cohorts of up to 30 scholars from English speaking-partners in the Africa, Latin America and Caribbean regions.
This module was piloted with Pacific and ASEAN scholars in 2021 and 2022 and have been adapted for each of the three regions to reflect local development priorities.</narrative>
  </description>
